          {
            "$ref": "#/parameters/projectId"
          },
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "**参数解释**:Lite Server实例ID。\n**约束限制**:^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[1-5][0-9a-f]{3}-[89ab][0-9a-f]{3}-[0-9a-f]{12}$。\n**取值范围**:不涉及。\n**默认取值**:不涉及。",
